<title>INDIA: Indian crude petroleum output fell in October.</title>
<headline>Indian crude petroleum output fell in October.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's crude petroleum production fell to 2.63 million tonnes in October 1996 from 2.92 million in the same month in 1995, the government said on Saturday.</p>
<p>    PETROLEUM OUTPUT    Oct 96    Oct 95	   Apr-Oct</p>
<p>							   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Crude		    2,630     2,919    18,468     20,567</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products   5,370     5,072    35,959     34,400</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. Figures for petroleum products relate to throughput.</p>
</text>
